{"id":"botschaft","lemma":"Botschaft","pos":"noun","rank":1421,"glosses":["message","news, tidings","embassy"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d6/De-Botschaft.ogg/De-Botschaft.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Botschaft","plural":"Botschaften"},"examples":[{"text":"Wo ist die Botschaft?","en":"Where is the embassy?","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Ich arbeite in der Botschaft.","en":"I work at the embassy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755299","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to work","l":"arbeiten"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Ich kann ihr die Botschaft nicht nahebringen.","en":"I can not get the message through to her.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Er hat Zugang zur amerikanischen Botschaft.","en":"He has access to the American Embassy.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"access"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"American","l":"amerikanisch"},null]},{"text":"Das ist die Botschaft.","en":"That's the message.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}